    },
    {
        "ID": "21, 98",
        "index": "0x1d9",
        "attributes": "1562000024000000ff00000005040400",
        "text": [
            "Ooh, je vois, c'est donc ça!",
            "Ils sont au village de Kakariko..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "ID": "21, 101",
        "index": "0x1dc",
        "attributes": "1565000024000000ff00000012040400",
        "text": [
            "Oh, d'accord, je comprends!",
